{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/b4607af24dc74c4393f4ec9f20829180/snapshots/4fedf22a70aa417ab8c0964002411f70-00001.jpg\"/><p>隨著連接陝西省會西安與安康市的高鐵線開通，來往兩地車程由以往約三小時，大幅縮短至約45分鐘。新建主線全長約171公里，設計時速350公里，由西安東站出發，穿越秦嶺，連接安康西站，沿線共設五個車站。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8501245_西康高鐵通車 西安安康四十五分 done - 截图6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/b4607af24dc74c4393f4ec9f20829180/snapshots/4fedf22a70aa417ab8c0964002411f70-00006.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p><strong>釋放貨運能力　助陝北煤炭南下</strong></p><p></p><p>中國鐵路西安局計劃統計部表示，西康高鐵進一步釋放包西及西康普速鐵路貨運能力，有效促進陝北煤炭、化工產品等大宗貨物南下運輸，為國家能源物流提供堅實運力支撐，並有助降低全社會整體物流成本。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T00:43:52.196559+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T09:30:05.728518+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T00:37:14.679671+00:00","content_hash":"4070542a3cd5a0e4a3c757f7a0b53e3ba0e76b44e8ff4899281b7e1bdc73aa37","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}